{% extends 'pages/communities/sagamok/members-first-plan-layout.html.twig' %}
{% set plan_key = 'lands' %}{% set plan_short = 'Lands, safety and rights' %}{% set plan_eyebrow = 'Priority 7' %}
{% set plan_title = 'Lands, safety and rights protected together' %}
{% set plan_description = 'Put jurisdiction, cumulative effects, community safety, emergency readiness and future generations into every land and resource decision.' %}
{% block plan_content %}
<section><header><p class="plan-kicker">The outcome</p><h2>Land decisions follow a public path and enforce clear community conditions.</h2><p class="plan-lede">Members see the proposal, affected area, rights at stake, expected benefit, risks, conditions, monitoring and enforcement before a major commitment is made.</p></header><div class="plan-grid plan-grid--3"><div class="plan-card"><h3>Jurisdiction first</h3><p>Begin with Sagamok law, rights, responsibilities and community priorities.</p></div><div class="plan-card"><h3>Cumulative view</h3><p>Assess combined effects on water, wildlife, access, culture and safety.</p></div><div class="plan-card"><h3>Conditions enforced</h3><p>Track every promise, permit condition, benefit and corrective action.</p></div></div></section>
<section><header><p class="plan-kicker">Year One commitments</p><h2>Build the decision and protection system.</h2></header><div class="plan-commitments"><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Lands decision protocol</h3><p>Define notice, information, technical review, member input, authority, reasons and appeal.</p></article><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Project and agreement register</h3><p>Publish active projects, counterparties, status, community conditions, benefits and review dates.</p></article><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Cumulative-effects baseline</h3><p>Map existing pressures, valued places, data gaps and monitoring priorities.</p></article><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Emergency readiness</h3><p>Update hazards, roles, evacuation, communications, vulnerable-member supports and exercises.</p></article><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Community safety plan</h3><p>Coordinate prevention, crisis response, safe transport, lighting, property and aftercare.</p></article><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Compliance tracker</h3><p>Record monitoring results, missed conditions, responsible parties and corrective deadlines.</p></article></div></section>
<section><header><p class="plan-kicker">Quarterly measures</p><h2>Measure protection and follow-through.</h2></header><div class="plan-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Land decisions</th><th>Conditions</th><th>Environment</th><th>Safety</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Projects at each review stage and member notices issued</td><td>Conditions due, met, overdue and corrected</td><td>Monitoring completed and threshold events</td><td>Emergency exercises, response gaps and actions closed</td></tr><tr><td>Decisions with reasons and benefit terms published</td><td>Benefits received against agreement</td><td>Data gaps assigned and resolved</td><td>Priority safety actions completed</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="plan-decision"><h2>Decisions members make</h2><ul><li>Which lands and waters require the strongest protection?</li><li>What projects require direct member consent?</li><li>What community benefits and safeguards are non-negotiable?</li><li>What happens when a project condition is missed?</li></ul></section>
<div class="plan-next"><a href="/communities/sagamok/members-first-plan/language-culture-learning">← Language, culture and learning</a><a href="/communities/sagamok/members-first-plan/public-service">Next: Public service →</a></div>
{% endblock %}
